  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiWROXsfgjkuYzFgouI1aGNMLBHEa_aLiEdOZel6iT_AKn5vU88DK9EFLFdfxoBfVE8DBcbcE-2nkssN8inTXTahL3TqOWhWWcN-zInyF5vWP7yKneiou2Vh-kgv-5oEjI3bURxdvFDON0ntVOXIjER_U_I1A00cvhIyRMIPmn6rxM5jucGMKFdD5wRJlE/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-11-16T195650.089.jpeg\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiWROXsfgjkuYzFgouI1aGNMLBHEa_aLiEdOZel6iT_AKn5vU88DK9EFLFdfxoBfVE8DBcbcE-2nkssN8inTXTahL3TqOWhWWcN-zInyF5vWP7yKneiou2Vh-kgv-5oEjI3bURxdvFDON0ntVOXIjER_U_I1A00cvhIyRMIPmn6rxM5jucGMKFdD5wRJlE/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-11-16T195650.089.jpeg\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">טייק אווי</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הִנֵּה רִבְקָה לְפָנֶיךָ קַח וָלֵךְ</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָעוֹלָם מָלֵא בְּלוֹקְחִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְגַם בְּלָקוֹחוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהַפּוֹלִיטִיקָאִים רוֹצִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָקַחַת קוֹלוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כֻּלָּם אוֹהֲבִים לָקַחַת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּקְצָת פָּחוֹת לָתֵת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה מְמַלֵּא אוֹתָם נַחַת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָקַחַת כָּל הָעֵת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קַח צִיפְרׇלֶקְס וְאָקָמוֹל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַל תִּשְׁכַּח וִיטָמִין דִּי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָקַחְתִּי מִסְפָּר, אֶתְמוֹל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי רִאשׁוֹן, אוֹ שֵּׁנִי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שַׂר הבט\"פ נוֹטֵל תַּקְצִיבִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּפְקוּדָיו - טְבִיעַת אֶצְבָּעוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוּא מֵדִיחַ נִצָּבִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְלוֹקֵחַ מַפְתְּחוֹת וּמוֹשְׁכוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"לָקַחַת פִּקּוּד\",</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">דּוֹרְשִׁים הַיְּמָנִים</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"קְחוּ אַחְרָיוּת\",</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צוֹעֲקִים הַשְּׂמֹאלָנִים</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"קַח רִיזִיקָה\",</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַצִּיעִים הַפַּרְשָׁנִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"take The דַאחְיַה\",</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַקְצִינִים הַקְּצִינִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵלּוּ כְּמוֹ אֵלּוּ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לוֹקְחִים סִכּוּנִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָקְחוּ קְצָת רֵסְקיוּ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהָרֹאשׁ בָּעֲנָנִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קַח לְךָ יוֹם חֹפֶשׁ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹ סְתָם יוֹם מַחֲלָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">טוּס, צֵא לְנֹפֶשׁ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵין? קַח הַלְוָאָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל, הַבַּנְקִים לוֹקְחִים עַמְלָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאוֹהֲבִים דְּמֵי נִהוּל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְמַתַּן מַשְׁכַּנְתָּא,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוֹסִיפוּ דְּמֵי תִּפְעוּל.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָקַחְתָּ לָרֵיאוֹת?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לָקַחְתָּ גַּם לַלֵּב?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם לוֹקְחִים שְׁתֵּי גְּלוּלוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">- זֶה סִימָן שֶׁכּוֹאֵב...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"לָקְחוּ לִי\"? \"שָׁתוּ לִי\"?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קַח אֶת זֶה בְּאִיזִי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָעִקָּר, קַח אוֹתִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִבְנֵי בְּרַק סִיטִי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לוֹקֵחַ אֶת עַצְמִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְלוֹקֵחַ פֶּסֶק זְמַן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"טַאֲטֵא קַח אוֹתִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַכְשָׁו - לְאֻמָּן\".</span></p>"
}
